<section class="section section-sand" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricing-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Prices</p>
    <h2 id="pricing-heading">What's the damage?</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">I'll always tell you the price before I start. No contracts, nothing to sign, no nasty surprises.</p>
    <div class="price-grid">
      <div class="price-card price-card-featured">
        <h3>Home visits</h3>
        <p class="price">{{ prices.hourly | gbp }}<span> an hour</span></p>
        <p>Charged per 30 minutes (£{{ prices.halfHour }} a go), so a quick job costs a quick price. No hidden extras, no rounding up to the nearest yacht.</p>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>{{ prices.billing }}</li>
          <li>{{ prices.travel }}</li>
          <li>I explain everything as I go</li>
          <li>Notes left behind if you'd like them</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact/#book" class="btn btn-accent">Book a visit</a>
      </div>
      <div class="price-card">
        <h3>{{ prices.diagnosis }}</h3>
        <p class="price">£0<span> to find out what's wrong</span></p>
        <p>I'll take a look, tell you what's up and what it'll cost to fix, before I touch a thing. Don't want to go ahead? You owe me nothing.</p>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>{{ prices.noFixNoFee }}. If I can't sort it, you don't pay</li>
          <li>Price agreed before I start</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="price-card">
        <h3>Help over the internet</h3>
        <p class="price">{{ prices.remote30 | gbp }}<span> for 30 mins</span></p>
        <p>Or {{ prices.remote60 | gbp }} for up to an hour. With your say-so, I can see your screen from here and fix things while you watch. Spooky, but handy.</p>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>Often the same day</li>
          <li>Handy if you're not local</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/remote-help/" class="btn btn-outline">How this works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="price-note">{{ prices.noFixNote }} {{ site.payment }}</p>
  </div>
</section>
